      "nets": ["UART3_TX_FCC", "UART3_RX_FCC", "I2C3_SDA_NAVC", "UART3_TX_NAVC"],
      "observed": "The FCC STM32H753 VCAP pins are connected to UART3_TX_FCC and UART3_RX_FCC. The NAVC STM32F405 VCAP_1 and VCAP_2 pins are connected to I2C3_SDA_NAVC and UART3_TX_NAVC. These VCAP pins are not shown with the required capacitors to ground.",
      "expected": "Each MCU's VCAP pin or pins should have the datasheet-required capacitor connection to ground and must not be connected to signal nets.",
